# Raw source datasets supplied by the data provider.
# These are inputs, not code: they may contain real patient records and must
# never enter version control or be redistributed. Only the de-identified,
# aggregate output under data/generated/ is ever committed or shipped.
#   Symptom-severity.csv  generic relative symptom weights, provider-owned
#   TestData.xlsx          REAL clinical records - PHI, local use only
raw-data/
*.xlsx
*.csv
!src/**/*.csv
!data/sources/*.csv
